{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-extractcolumnmetatfeatures-tdata-tvalue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: ExtractColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type ExtractColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? ColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue> : TFeatures extends object ? TMeta : ColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/ColumnDef.ts#L36","children":[{"type":"text","value":"types/ColumnDef.ts:36"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resolves the type of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnDef.meta"},{"type":"text","value":" for a feature set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When the features object declares a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" type-only slot\n("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableFeatures({ ..., columnMeta: {} as MyColumnMeta })"},{"type":"text","value":"), that type wins.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ColumnMeta"},{"type":"text","value":"\ninterface."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"RowData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvalue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"CellData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CellData"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"CellData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CellData"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-extractcolumnmetatfeatures-tdata-tvalue","text":"Type Alias: ExtractColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: ExtractColumnMeta\\<TFeatures, TData, TValue\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? ColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue> : TFeatures extends object ? TMeta : ColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/ColumnDef.ts:36](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/ColumnDef.ts#L36)\n\nResolves the type of `columnDef.meta` for a feature set.\n\nWhen the features object declares a `columnMeta` type-only slot\n(`tableFeatures({ ..., columnMeta: {} as MyColumnMeta })`), that type wins.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged `ColumnMeta`\ninterface.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](RowData.md)\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* [`CellData`](CellData.md) = [`CellData`](CellData.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ExtractColumnMeta\ntitle: ExtractColumnMeta\n---\n\n# Type Alias: ExtractColumnMeta\\<TFeatures, TData, TValue\\>\n\n```ts\ntype ExtractColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue> = IsAny<TFeatures> extends true ? ColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue> : TFeatures extends object ? TMeta : ColumnMeta<TFeatures, TData, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/ColumnDef.ts:36](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/ColumnDef.ts#L36)\n\nResolves the type of `columnDef.meta` for a feature set.\n\nWhen the features object declares a `columnMeta` type-only slot\n(`tableFeatures({ ..., columnMeta: {} as MyColumnMeta })`), that type wins.\nOtherwise this falls back to the global declaration-merged `ColumnMeta`\ninterface.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](RowData.md)\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* [`CellData`](CellData.md) = [`CellData`](CellData.md)\n"}
